title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.game_over = 1;
// Achievements:
// Große Koalition - form a grand coalition
// Eiserne Front - Form the Iron Front.
this.achieve('game_completed');

// (Social Democracy / Weimar achievements removed for this mod — only game_completed and the Mexican game_achievement_* flags apply.)
!}

= End

@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@el_estado_final
view-if: ending
title: El estado de la República…
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

[? if ending = "reconocimiento" : An elected result the regime could not steal; the Mexican transition began by being counted. ?][? if ending = "historico" : Salinas governs a country that no longer believes him; facing him, the new party — founded on your registro. ?][? if ending = "ruptura" : The state prevailed over the Eleven Days; the country that watched does not forget. The lists survived. ?][? if ending = "irrelevancia" : The system continues; the wave passed; the Movement remained whole, and on the shore. ?][? if ending = "fuerte" : A mass left, too large for the regime to round to zero. It did not win the night, but it made the next one thinkable. ?][? if ending = "media" : A real national organization, and the possibility of power held in reserve. ?][? if ending = "debil" : Survived, small and battered, the list intact. The seed keeps in the cold. ?][? if ending = "guerra_larga" : The war would not end. While the country counted its ballot, the sierra kept its own calendar — and kept it into the next decade, waiting. ?][? if ending = "exterminio" : The war was ended the way wars against the poor are ended — completely, and then denied. The runway points at the sea. The corridos keep the count. ?][? if ending = "aniquilacion" : The system outlived you. Somewhere, on some rooftop, someone still keeps a mimeograph. ?][? if ending = "intervencion" : The older catastrophe: the regime fell, and something worse came through the door it left open. ?]

@achievements
title: Achievements
view-if: achievement_game_completed == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

= Completed Achievements in this Playthrough

[? if game_achievement_la_guerra_larga : **La guerra larga** — the armed road neither won nor was crushed: it endured past 1988, into the next decade, and kept the light on. ?][? if game_achievement_el_exterminio : **El exterminio** — the armed road was crushed to the last camp. They killed the column; they never found where it kept the reason. ?][? if game_achievement_el_palacio_negro : **El Palacio Negro** — the Movement was annihilated. The list survives you. ?]

[? if game_achievement_la_semilla : **La semilla** — survive the long decade, however small. ?]

