= Los caminos no andados — roads not yet walked

*Every line below is a history your Mexico has not yet authored, across every run you have played. The next Movement inherits this list the way it inherits the dead: as an invitation. Some of these require the reformist road, some the armed, some a Mexico where Lucio lives or the women's movement is embraced or the vote is finally counted. Pick one you have not touched, and go bend it.*

